msgid "Every New button opens the way you like to work. Quick is a small card — customer, items and quantities, with prices, terms and validity from the defaults; type “200 cam” and press Enter. Standard shows the essential fields, Detailed every field. Switch at the top of any form without losing what you typed; the arrow changes your default."
